	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0402_woman2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かわれば　まえのままが　よくて
かわらなければ　たいくつ　という……▽
そんな　ワガママな　わたし　です</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T08:22:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-07T03:14:52" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>変われば　前のままが　よくて
変わらなければ　退屈という……▽
そんな　ワガママな　わたし　です</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T08:22:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
